@startuml FileManagementSystem_Class_Diagram

' File Management System Class Diagram

class FileInfo {
    + Name: string
    + FullPath: string
    + Extension: string
    + SizeInBytes: long
    + CreatedDate: DateTime
    + ModifiedDate: DateTime
    + LastAccessDate: DateTime
    + Attributes: FileAttributes
    + IsDirectory: bool
    + IsReadOnly: bool
    + IsHidden: bool
    + SizeFormatted: string {readonly}
    + FileType: string {readonly}
}

class FileManager {
    - _currentDirectory: string
    + ShowCurrentDirectory(): void
    + ListFiles(): void
    + SearchFiles(): void
    + CreateFile(): void
    + DeleteFile(): void
    + ShowFileInfo(): void
    - GetFileList(directory: string): List<FileInfo>
    - CreateCustomFileInfo(fileInfo: System.IO.FileInfo): FileInfo
    - GetAllFilesRecursively(directory: string): List<FileInfo>
    - FormatBytes(bytes: long): string
}

FileManager --> FileInfo : creates/manages

note right of FileManager : SINGLE RESPONSIBILITY\nPRINCIPLE\nHandles all file operations

@enduml

